# Lonestar6 (linux x86_64, CPython 3.14.7) environment inputs. Every package that also
# exists in the Mac environment is held to its requirements-lock.txt version; the
# Linux-only CUDA runtime packages are pinned by torch 2.15.0 itself (CUDA 13.2).
# Regenerate requirements-tacc-lock.txt with scripts/tacc/compile_lock.sh.
-c ../../requirements-lock.txt
torch==2.15.0
numpy
safetensors
huggingface_hub
tokenizers
pyyaml
pytest
